    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Nathalie Levy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101968289320589319436/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVsxxIxweC7S_4zfkc7tarJxRCElB0AhXS11ZDYvbp5fOYfxl9VZQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "I brought my lehenga and sari to Jyoti for reworking, and she did an outstanding job. The fit is absolutely perfect! She understood exactly what I wanted and executed it flawlessly. Her work is truly amazing.\n\nOn top of that, the turnaround was so fast, and she’s incredibly kind, warm, and easy to work with. It’s rare to find someone who delivers both quality and exceptional service.\n\nI couldn’t recommend Jyoti more. If you need a tailor or seamstress who will make your outfit look and feel perfect, she’s the one!",
        "time": 1763766391,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "courtney Pim",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115803391884813754164/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIWs4GtJxpmd_BmQx34WUz-PsEfDQ5_9V8xB_fMxKI4ktpbAw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I cannot thank Joyti enough for the magic she worked on my lehenga! ✨ She took something I was nervous about and turned it into the most beautiful, perfectly fitted piece I could have dreamed of. The attention to detail, the care she put into every stitch, and the way she truly understood my vision was beyond impressive. When I tried it on after her alterations, it felt like it was made just for me — comfortable, elegant, and absolutely stunning.\n\nJoyti is so talented, professional, and kind, and I would recommend her to anyone who wants their outfit to look flawless. She didn’t just fix my lehenga, she transformed it into something I’ll cherish forever. 💙",
        "time": 1756764605,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
